title: Card details asked for with a lure
severity: high
score: 45
tags: phishing, card-harvest
attack: T1566.002, T1056.003
description: A page asks for card details (number with CVV or expiry) and has another
  phishing trait. The traits are: a delivery-fee, customs or fine pretext, a lookalike or
  government-lookalike domain, free hosting, or a domain under 30 days old.
---
// A card-number form on a page no known brand or allowlisted site runs ...
card_pages
// ... with a reason to pay, or on a lookalike, free-hosted or young domain.
| where exists(payment_pretext_frames)
    or exists(lookalike_hosts)
    or exists(government_lookalike_hosts)
    or exists(final_free_hosting)
    or toscalar(final_domain | project age_days) < 30
| project url
